      "content": "Hey, I'm working on the draft for the NIH grant. I need the \"Results and Impact\" section to really hit hard. Can you write a summary of our recent Protein-X/Disease-Y trials? Specifically, how strong is the statistical evidence for our hypothesis? We need the reviewers to feel like this is a sure thing.",
